SUMMARY:Symposium: Immigrant Artists in Vermont
LOCATION:Brattleboro Museum & Art Center\, 10 Vernon St\, Brattleboro\, VT 
 05301
DESCRIPTION:What has drawn immigrant artists to Vermont over the past two c
 enturies? How has Vermont shaped their work\, and how have these artists\,
  in turn\, shaped Vermont’s evolving cultural identity?\nhttps://www.bra
 ttleboromuseum.org/event/symposium-immigrant-artists-in-vermont/\nFrom Pus
 hpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
