UID:1bab9adc50208dec6166e5845da6b0e5efca1197@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART:20270220T223000Z
DTEND:20270221T003000Z
SUMMARY:Art Talk: Sara Jimenez & Sarah Freeman
LOCATION:Brattleboro Museum & Art Center\, 10 Vernon St\, Brattleboro\, VT 
 05301
DESCRIPTION:Artist Sara Jimenez and curator Sarah Freeman discuss Jimenez
 ’s installation the story never stops beginning or ending\, exploring ho
 w textiles\, ceramics\, and collaged imagery bring together personal memor
 y and histories of American colonization in the Philippines. Through layer
 ed landscapes and sculptural forms honoring Filipino women and non-binary 
 individuals\, Jimenez creates a space for reflection on history\, remembra
 nce\, and care.\nhttps://www.brattleboromuseum.org/event/art-talk-sara-jim
 enez-sarah-freeman/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
 rnma/
URL:https://www.brattleboromuseum.org/event/art-talk-sara-jimenez-sarah-fre
 eman/
